			"notes": "First release, for Minecraft 26.3 on Fabric and NeoForge.\n\n- Death drops stay with your body instead of scattering.\n- Take all, or Shift + right-click, puts items back in their original empty slots and leaves the rest in the body.\n- Death scenes for lava, fire, drowning, falls, explosions, lightning, arrows, spiders, freezing, poison, wither, the Warden, melee, bee stings, cactus, starvation, anvils, stalactites, tridents and maces.\n- Bodies float, can be buried by sand and gravel, turn to skeletons over time, and can be punched away once empty.\n- Owner, team or public access, plus operator commands for listing, inspecting, repairing and deleting bodies."
		}
